tegrated into Envato's VideoGen","item":"https://www.minimax.io/news/hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen"}]}]}</script><main class="flex flex-col items-center w-full overflow-y-auto flex-1 pb-[160px] min-h-screen"><div class="px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[1000px] flex flex-col items-center mt-[80px]"><div class="text-brand-1 text-[14px] font-[400] leading-[21px] mb-[24px]">July 3, 2025 </div><h1 class="m-0 p-0 text-center text-brand-1 text-[54px] font-[500] leading-[86.4px] pb-[36px]">Hailuo-02 is Now Integrated into Envato&#x27;s VideoGen</h1></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">Hailuo-02, our latest AI video generation model, is now integrated into Envato's VideoGen module.</div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] py-[48px]"><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="relative max-w-full overflow-hidden" style="width:384px;height:384px"><img alt="" fetchPriority="high" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="rounded-[12px] object-contain object-top" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">Envato is the ultimate all-in-one platform for creative professionals, offering millions of high-quality assets alongside a growing suite of AI-powered tools. With VideoGen, Envato’s AI video generation tool, creators can transform text and image prompts into dynamic, short videos. By integrating world-class models like Hailuo-02, Envato continues to empower creators with cutting-edge technology that makes video content creation faster, easier, and more accessible. With the power of Hailuo-02, VideoGen now delivers even more realistic, controllable, and cinematic video outputs — empowering users to transform ideas into high-fidelity visuals within seconds.</br></br>


Hailuo-02 has world-class quality with record-breaking cost efficiency, that can easily handle extreme physics. This integration enables creators across Envato's vast community to access the next generation of AI-driven video content creation.</br></br>

At MiniMax, our mission is Intelligence with everyone. We're excited to collaborate with Envato to support a new wave of visual storytelling.</br></br>

Try it today via VideoGen on Envato, bring your ideas to life!</div></main><footer class="bg-black px-6 md:px-[60px] pt-20 pb-10"><div class="max-w-[1920px] mx-auto"></div></footer><script src="https://file.cdn.minimax.io/open_platform_web/prod-en-minimax-0.1.92/_next/static/chunks/webpack-d12ed500995eea27.js" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"https://file.cdn.minimax.io/open_platform_web/prod-en-minimax-0.1.92/_next/static/css/3c3a8b1e2c34daf6.css\",\"style\"]\n2:HL[\"https://file.cdn.minimax.io/open_platform_web/prod-en-minimax-0.1.92/_next/static/css/d8e3b3484e561eab.css\",\"style\"]\n3:HL[\"https://file.cdn.minimax.io/open_platform_web/prod-en-minimax-0.1.92/_next/static/css/0b3795b5632a5dce.css\",\"style\"]\n4:HL[\"https://file.cdn.minimax.io/open_platform_web/prod-en-minimax-0.1.92/_next/static/css/5cc4a1b41a53e6d7.css\",\"style\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:I[73650,[],\"\"]\n8:I[71498,[],\"\"]\na:I[41570,[],\"\"]\nd:I[86597,[\"6470\",\"static/chunks/app/global-error-c108508335b02915.js\"],\"default\"]\n9:[\"detail\",\"hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen\",\"d\"]\ne:[]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"buildId\":\"yBXiuyqxqiLCpPw_eApbo\",\"assetPrefix\":\"https://file.cdn.minimax.io/open_platform_web/prod-en-minimax-0.1.92\",\"urlParts\":[\"\",\"news\",\"hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen\"],\"initialTree\":[\"\",{\"children\":[\"news\",{\"children\":[[\"detail\",\"hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen\",\"d\"],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{}]}]}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],\"initialSeedData\":[\"\",{\"children\":[\"news\",{\"children\":[[\"detail\",\"hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen\",\"d\"],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{},[[\"$L6\",\"$L7\",[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"https://file.cdn.minimax.io/open_pl