e31f-448a-9823-e2220e49b426.png\",\"description\":\"Building AGI with our mission Intelligence with Everyone. Global leader in multi-modal models and AI-native products with over 200 million users.\",\"slogan\":\"Intelligence with Everyone\"},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/#website\",\"url\":\"https://www.minimax.io\",\"name\":\"MiniMax\",\"description\":\"Building AGI with our mission Intelligence with Everyone. Global leader in multi-modal models and AI-native products with over 200 million users.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news\"}}},{\"@type\":\"NewsArticle\",\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen#article\",\"headline\":\"Hailuo-02 is Now Integrated into Envato's VideoGen\",\"description\":\"Hailuo-02 AI video model now integrated into Envato VideoGen. Transform text \u0026 images to cinematic videos instantly. World-class quality, cost-efficient. Try VideoGen today!\",\"image\":[],\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/#organization\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen\"},\"articleSection\":\"News\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"copyrightYear\":2026,\"copyrightHolder\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/#organization\"}},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.minimax.io\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"What's New\",\"item\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Hailuo-02 is Now Integrated into Envato's VideoGen\",\"item\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen\"}]}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1b:T47f,Envato is the ultimate all-in-one platform for creative professionals, offering millions of high-quality assets alongside a growing suite of AI-powered tools. With VideoGen, Envato’s AI video generation tool, creators can transform text and image prompts into dynamic, short videos. By integrating world-class models like Hailuo-02, Envato continues to empower creators with cutting-edge technology that makes video content creation faster, easier, and more accessible. With the power of Hailuo-02, VideoGen now delivers even more realistic, controllable, and cinematic video outputs — empowering users to transform ideas into high-fidelity visuals within seconds.\u003c/br\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\n\n\nHailuo-02 has world-class quality with record-breaking cost efficiency, that can easily handle extreme physics. This integration enables creators across Envato's vast community to access the next generation of AI-driven video content creation.\u003c/br\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\n\nAt MiniMax, our mission is Intelligence with everyone. We're excited to collaborate with Envato to support a new wave of visual storytelling.\u003c/br\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\n\nTry it today via VideoGen on Envato, bring your ideas to life!7:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$19\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"data\":{\"base_resp\":{\"status_code\":0,\"status_msg\":\"success\"},\"title\":\"Hailuo-02 is Now Integrated into Envato's VideoGen\",\"summary\":\"Hailuo-02 AI video model now integrated into Envato VideoGen. Transform text \u0026 images to cinematic videos instantly. World-class quality, cost-efficient. Try VideoGen today!\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"fdc4910e-8930-4db6-b71b-05f278df5c99\",\"type\":\"ArticleTitle\",\"props\":{\"date\":\"July 3, 2025 \",\"title\":\"Hailuo-02 is Now Integrated into Envato's VideoGen\"},\"children\":[]},{\"id\":\"5cb2a700-00f1-4bb4-8612-436e4c22ef58\",\"type\":\"ArticleParagraph\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"Hailuo-02, our latest AI video generation model, is now integrated into Envato's VideoGen module.\"},\"children\":[]},{\"id\":\"46c87728-49f5-4d46-9d45-26634e203dd5\",\"type\":\"ArticleImage\",\"props"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\":{\"src\":\"https://filecdn.minimax.chat/public/6e8175f2-7948-4cd8-a42f-4bfcfe964742.PNG\",\"aspectRatio\":\"2:2\"},\"children\":[]},{\"id\":\"2e0ee24a-17e8-4db2-bbe9-8bb989d5ceb3\",\"type\":\"ArticleParagraph\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"$1b\"},\"children\":[]}],\"slug\":\"hailuo-02-is-now-integrated-into-envatos-videogen\"}}]]\n"])</script></body></html>